  "slug": "performance-improvement-evaluation-form",
  "title": "Performance Improvement Evaluation Form",
  "subtitle": "Use this evaluation to apply explicit criteria to traceable evidence, calibrate the conclusion, authorize action, and preserve limitations for a performance improvement workflow.",
  "description": "An original operational performance improvement evaluation form that controls a objective performance-support and review record from identity and routing through evidence, qualified decision, exception management, implementation, handoff, and final verification.",
  "use_case": "Use when the manager, employee, or HR case owner needs a traceable evaluation so the qualified HR, employee-relations, legal, or management reviewer can start, revise, extend, complete, close, or escalate the performance-improvement process under the current job description, consistently applied performance standards, accommodation process, employee-relations policy, and applicable employment requirements without relying on an informal email, spreadsheet, or unreviewed narrative.",
  "risk_tier": "C",
